### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
###  Elasticsearch 검색 API 테스트
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

### 전체 필드 키워드 검색 (한국어)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/search?q=도서관 HTTP/1.1

### 제목 필드 검색
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/search?q=디지털&field=title HTTP/1.1

### 저자 검색
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/search?q=홍길동&field=author HTTP/1.1

### 주제 검색
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/search?q=데이터&field=subject HTTP/1.1

### ISBN 검색
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/search?q=9788900000001&field=isbn HTTP/1.1

### 페이지네이션
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/search?q=도서관&from=0&size=5 HTTP/1.1

### 자동완성
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/search/suggest?q=디지 HTTP/1.1

### 자동완성 (데이터)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/search/suggest?q=데이터 HTTP/1.1

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
###  기존 서지 API 테스트
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

### 서지 목록
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/bibs HTTP/1.1

### 서지 검색 (PostgreSQL ILIKE)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/bibs/search?q=디지털&field=title HTTP/1.1

### 서지 상세
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/bibs/1 HTTP/1.1

### 서지 등록
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/bibs HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "control_number": "KMO202300003",
  "title": "정보검색론",
  "main_entry": "김철수",
  "publisher": "한빛미디어",
  "pub_year": 2024,
  "isbn": "9788900000003",
  "call_number": "025.04-김23ㅈ"
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
###  전자자원 API 테스트
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

### 전자자원 목록
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/e-resources HTTP/1.1

### Cost Per Use
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/e-resources/stats/cost-per-use?year=2024 HTTP/1.1

### 헬스체크
GET http://localhost:4000/health HTTP/1.1
